WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:03.285
(upbeat guitar music)

00:00:05.182 --> 00:00:07.322
- We just have to see how the
rest of the year is going.

00:00:07.322 --> 00:00:08.642
Like I need everybody,

00:00:08.642 --> 00:00:09.486
We had that sales dip

00:00:09.486 --> 00:00:10.936
with merchandise, probably
(droning buzz)

00:00:10.936 --> 00:00:11.943
due to the blizzard.

00:00:11.943 --> 00:00:13.719
In February we were
able to get it back up,

00:00:13.719 --> 00:00:14.681
but we need to stay strong.

00:00:16.637 --> 00:00:18.253
- What's your opinion on kombucha?

00:00:18.253 --> 00:00:19.692
- Fungus, or whatever it is,

00:00:19.692 --> 00:00:21.111
I had to drop it off at the hotel

00:00:21.111 --> 00:00:22.654
and they'll feed it, 'cause
you have to feed it--

00:00:22.654 --> 00:00:25.545
(random music blaring)

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:28.743
- Yeah, the date was amazing.

00:00:28.743 --> 00:00:30.044
She's like a mix of Jennifer Connelly,

00:00:30.044 --> 00:00:31.263
but cuter, if you can imagine--

00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:32.830
- Oh my god, that reminds me!

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:35.326
The cutest puppy jumped
in my lap yesterday

00:00:35.326 --> 00:00:36.189
when I was in the lobby.

00:00:36.189 --> 00:00:37.524
It's that kind of dog you love,

00:00:37.524 --> 00:00:38.465
Right, this has nothing to do with

00:00:38.465 --> 00:00:39.289
what you were talking about, I'm sorry.

00:00:41.972 --> 00:00:45.116
(papers shuffling)

00:00:45.116 --> 00:00:46.551
(papers crumpling)

00:00:50.212 --> 00:00:51.430
- Hey, I gotta run real fast,

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:52.905
but do you mind emailing Linda

00:00:52.905 --> 00:00:54.343
and making sure that she comes tomorrow

00:00:54.343 --> 00:00:55.574
and brings the cake and everything?

00:00:55.574 --> 00:00:56.411
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:00:56.411 --> 00:00:57.588
- Cool, thank you.

00:00:57.588 --> 00:00:59.019
(bubble bursts)

00:00:59.019 --> 00:00:59.680
- Shit.

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:00.612
What did she just say?

00:01:02.536 --> 00:01:03.706
- My desk, 10 minutes.

00:01:03.706 --> 00:01:04.508
- Okay, okay.

00:01:05.758 --> 00:01:07.097
(bursting poof)

00:01:07.097 --> 00:01:08.160
- It's been 30 minutes.

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:09.257
- Oh, shit.

00:01:09.257 --> 00:01:10.225
Nick, I'm sorry.

00:01:12.101 --> 00:01:14.354
- I was in this analytics
meeting the other day,

00:01:14.354 --> 00:01:16.595
could not concentrate to save my life.

00:01:16.595 --> 00:01:17.921
Swear I have ADHD.

00:01:17.921 --> 00:01:19.495
(cartoonish popping)

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.429
- I don't know if that's how that works.

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:26.909
(upbeat guitar music)

